    "text": "KNOW YE that by virtue of the powers vested in me by Article 70 of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, Anura Kumara Dissanayake, President of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this Proclamation, summon Parliament to meet at the Chamber of Parliament, Sri Jayawardenepura, on the Twenty First day of November, Two Thousand and Twenty Four, at 10.00 a.m.",
